{2}╭─────────────────────────────────────────────╮{R}
{2}│{R}{1}⦿ Generate shell completion scripts          {R}{2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Usage:                                     {R}{2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter completion <shell>{R}                   {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Examples:                                  {R}{2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter completion bash{R}                      {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter completion fish > otter.fish{R}         {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Shells:                                    {R}{2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}bash, zsh, fish, pwsh{R}                      {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Extras:                                    {R}{2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--help{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-h{R}  {5}Show this help message{R}      {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Notes:                                     {R}{2}│{R}
{2}│{R}{5}Prints the script to stdout.{R}                 {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}{5}Redirect to your shell's completion dir.{R}     {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}{5}Restart the shell, or source the script.{R}     {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}{5}Regenerate after upgrading otter.{R}            {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ See also:                                  {R}{2}│{R}
{2}│{R}{5}See Installation in otter documentation.{R}     {2}│{R}
